{"ref":"character:suor-clerici","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Suor Clerici is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.2.10. Her starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Santa_Water.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:santa-water"}," ",{"t":"Santa Water","r":"weapon:santa-water"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["30 January 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Clerici"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["GERMANA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Santa_Water.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:santa-water"}," ",{"t":"Santa Water","r":"weapon:santa-water"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Recover a total of 1000 HP."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Details","cells":[["Area bonus is reduced by 100% per level until level 5."]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["150"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["0.50"]]},{"label":"Area","cells":[["+400%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The player can unlock Clerici by recovering 1,000 HP total over the course of all runs. She is then available to purchase for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Clerici can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"faschiuma\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Clerici starts with +50 ",{"i":"Sprite-Hollow_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," and +0.5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},". Additionally, Clerici starts with +400% ",{"i":"Sprite-Candelabrador.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", however, the bonus depreciates by 100% each level, until the bonus is entirely gone at level 5."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Area"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+400%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+300%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+200%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+100%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5+"]},{"c":["0%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Suor Clerici's low-level ",{"i":"Sprite-Candelabrador.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"}," bonus applies to the gem explosions of the ",{"i":"Sprite-Game_Killer_(0).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:game-killer-0"}," ",{"t":"Game Killer (0)","r":"weapon:game-killer-0"}," Arcana, allowing every single gem blast to cover most of the screen and hit dozens of enemies at once. It also locks Clerici at level 1 so her temporary bonus never goes down."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Suor_Clerici.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Default Suor sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Suor_Clerici_(Legacy).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Legacy Suor sprite."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated-sprites","title":"Animated sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Suor_Clerici.gif","w":105,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of default Suor."]},{"i":"Animated-Suor_Clerici_(Legacy).gif","w":104,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of legacy Suor."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Suor_Clerici_talking_to_Poe.png","w":300,"h":136,"c":["Suor Clerici talking to ",{"i":"Sprite-Poe_Ratcho.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," ",{"t":"Poe Ratcho","r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," about the PlayStation release of Vampire Survivors in the video \"Sopravvissuti ai vampiri è su PlayStation\"."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 7 July 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Default skin added to game."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 2 March 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," bonus for Clerici."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 30 January 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Suor is Italian for \"nun\". Clerici is Latin for \"priests\" or \"of a priest\"."]},{"c":["Her name comes from ",{"t":"Antonella Clerici","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antonella_Clerici"},", an Italian TV host also referenced in \"La Borra\"."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}